&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A knack for bringing order to chaos and an enthusiastic &quot;roll up your sleeves&quot; mentality. You are a true team player&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analytical approach to understanding customer needs combined with creative follow-up to advance opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Passion for emerging technologies like AI, with interest in ensuring they are developed safely and responsibly&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A strategic, analytical approach to assessing markets combined with creative, tactical execution to capture opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Interest in or passion for social impact and mission-driven work. You feel strongly about ensuring frontier AI systems are developed safely and ethically&lt;/p&gt;
